OL,3,A'Miracle' eagle with broken wing
OL,4,Aspotted back above Scottish coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetired RSPB officer Dave Sexton, whose
OL,7,Fhas worked with the island's sea eagles
OL,8,Ffor more than 20 years, described the
OL,9,Fsighting as "incredible".
